                    106.0,
                    892.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Any employee who, after the effective date of this Agreement, is laid off and recalled without loss of seniority during the term of this Agreement and who was having dues or Agency fees deducted from his or her pay in accordance with this Section at the time of layoff, will have said dues or Agency fees deducted from his or her pay upon recall; provided that the Employer has in its files, a valid Deduction Authorization form for such employee.",
